{
  "info": {
    "name": "Orquestrador Studio — shots (Etapa 5, OS-005)",
    "description": "Contratos públicos da seção 5 do FDD `docs/domains/shots/features/shots-fdd.md`.\n\nPré-requisitos para rodar: Studio no ar (`PORT=8769 ./run.sh`) e um projeto cujo `storyboard/scenes.json` já exista (etapa 4) com `cena01`, além de `base/base_final.png` (etapa 3). Ajuste as variáveis `baseUrl` e `pid`.\n\nAs rotas multipart (`import/upload`, `base/upload`, `product/ref`) exigem um arquivo local e por isso ficam desabilitadas por padrão no runner: preencha `formdata.src` antes de rodar.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {"key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8769"},
    {"key": "pid", "value": "2026-08-gelo-zero"},
    {"key": "scene", "value": "cena01"},
    {"key": "candidateId", "value": ""}
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Catálogo — etapa 5 pronta",
      "request": {"method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/steps"},
      "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
        "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
        "const shots = pm.response.json().find(s => s.id === 'shots');",
        "pm.test('shots ready, n=5, aula 011', () => {",
        "  pm.expect(shots.status).to.eql('ready');",
        "  pm.expect(shots.n).to.eql(5);",
        "  pm.expect(shots.aula).to.eql('011');",
        "});"
      ]}}]
    },
    {
      "name": "Listar cenas com status, paleta e aviso",
      "request": {"method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{pid}}/shots/scenes"},
      "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
        "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
        "const b = pm.response.json();",
        "pm.test('aviso de cores e luz da aula 011', () => pm.expect(b.warning).to.include('ANTES do multishot'));",
        "pm.test('paleta e cenas presentes', () => {",
        "  pm.expect(b.palette).to.have.property('colors');",
        "  pm.expect(b.scenes).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
        "  pm.expect(b.product_scene).to.have.property('ref_ready');",
        "});"
      ]}}]
    },
    {
      "name": "Projeto inexistente é 404",
